      "widgets_values": [
        "第一个开始说话的人 - The first person to speak\n\n\n(copied from the workflow note: \"第一个开始说话的人 - The first person to speak\").\n\nThe previous pattern expected \"speaker\" (e.g., \"First speaker\" or \"First speaker who speaks\"), and did not match \"person to speak\", raising: ValueError: 说话人分离请填写开始说话的顺序，例如“第一个开始说话的人”或“first speaker”\n\n\n\n\nExpanded the speaker order parser to match phrases like \"The first person to speak\", \"first person who speaks\", \"the first one to speak\", etc.\nAdded fallback: if left completely blank on Speaker Separation, it now automatically defaults to speaker 1 (\"Keep only the first speaker\")."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "第一个开始说话的人 - The first person to speak\n\n\n(copied from the workflow note: \"第一个开始说话的人 - The first person to speak\").\n\nThe previous pattern expected \"speaker\" (e.g., \"First speaker\" or \"First speaker who speaks\"), and did not match \"person to speak\", raising: ValueError: 说话人分离请填写开始说话的顺序，例如“第一个开始说话的人”或“first speaker”\n\n\n\n\nExpanded the speaker order parser to match phrases like \"The first person to speak\", \"first person who speaks\", \"the first one to speak\", etc.\nAdded fallback: if left completely blank on Speaker Separation, it now automatically defaults to speaker 1 (\"Keep only the first speaker\")."
